The Court in the exercise of judicial review must restrict its review to determine whether:
(i) the rules of natural justice have been complied with;
(ii) the finding of misconduct is based on some evidence;
(iii) the statutory rules governing the conduct of the disciplinary enquiry have been observed; and Vilayati Ram Son Of Late. Charan Das vs The State Of Rajasthan ... on 6 January, 2026 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/19920331/
